('notable_npc', 'rainbow-serpent-avatar', 'Swallow', 'Special: the target is destroyed forever or sent to a distant dimension', 0, NULL, 'Needs only a strike roll; the maw takes anything up to 500 feet (152 m) in diameter. Always its last act: the avatar then dies and fades away with what it swallowed. A banished evil needs at least 3D6x1,000 years to escape and is unlikely to return to Earth.', 4);
